__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
.venv/
ocr_diagnostic_*.png
ocr_diagnostic_*_prepared.png
lobby_diagnostic_*.png

# Screenshots dropped in for context during a session (bug reports, "here is what
# it looks like on screen"). Deliberately NOT committed: they are multi-megabyte
# PNGs and the folder only grows, so committing them would bloat git history
# permanently for evidence that is useful for one conversation. Anything worth
# keeping from a screenshot belongs in Error_history.txt as measured numbers.
assets/zelScreenshots/

# Monster detector training images and the model built from them - see
# assets/monsters/README.txt and docs/monster_detection_plan.txt. The class
# FOLDERS are tracked (each holds a .gitkeep) and so is the README, but their
# contents are not: same reasoning as zelScreenshots above - large binaries
# that only grow - and monsters.onnx is reproducible from the images anyway.
assets/monsters/*/*
!assets/monsters/*/.gitkeep
assets/monsters/monsters.onnx
assets/monsters/monsters.json

# Benchmark/experiment outputs - models downloaded and exported by
# tools/benchmark_detector.py, and the annotated PNGs tools/zeroshot_check.py
# writes. All reproducible by re-running the scripts.
tools/_benchmark_models/
*.onnx
zeroshot_result*.png
zeroshot_scene.png
